// all, 0.75 a core). `tempAssumed` (a sentence) marks a `temp` that nobody read
// from the maker: the pages then say "assumed". Microcontrollers carry
// the tag `mcu`; their `power.w` is what a board sleeping between readings
// averages with sensible firmware, which a dev board's LEDs and USB bridge can
